# Build and upload tooling for CI, the publish workflow and the malware
# scan. hatchling is here because the workflows build with --no-isolation,
# so the build backend comes from this lock too. build.txt is compiled from
# this file with hashes for every package in the tree:
#   uv pip compile build.in --universal --generate-hashes --python-version 3.12 -o build.txt
